      "created_at": "2017-01-05T14:07:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, this came up in a game last night -- Harvest the Mighty hits the character with the most cards in play; I was playing Extremist Sky-Scraper and the most cards in play were the three links I'd put on Chokepoint, so she ate the damage. Then it says to take a card from that hero's play area and put it face down in Chokepoint's area. Since none of the links were in <em>Sky-Scraper's</em> play area, the table decided to flip none of them. Is this correct?</p><p>Second question, never actually came up, but can you use any part of Huge Extremist's power if there are no environment cards out?</p>",
