      "created_at": "2017-01-05T14:16:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes on both. &nbsp; If you have no link cards in your play area or any other cards then she can't take them even if you do have cards out in other play areas. &nbsp;For the second one it just means you automatically deal that sonic damage to all targets since no Environment target was destroyed and you revert back to normal sized. &nbsp;</p>",
